                            {
                                "target_word": "darkstep",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f4145ea-a5a9-33f4-a15b-d6d7b7dcd7b7",
                                        "entry_id": "7c060fb9-7f73-323a-b85d-11cd18f0ab44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A subgenre of dubstep with a fast tempo that incorporates ambient and industrial samples."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42486186-dc38-4cd5-bb3a-4ddd2b1451ca",
                                                "sense_id": "9f4145ea-a5a9-33f4-a15b-d6d7b7dcd7b7",
                                                "text": "Another area where I suspect there's some crossover, but I haven't poked around in much, is within death/black metal. Certainly some of what I've heard has the dark techy feel of techstep / darkstep like Technical Itch and whatnot, but it's not something I've had the time to look into properly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e5785ab-9512-4948-8de8-7d315e1b118a",
                                                "sense_id": "9f4145ea-a5a9-33f4-a15b-d6d7b7dcd7b7",
                                                "text": "This record is a standout in the records of Six Finger Satellite as it takes a dance tone. Some darkstep dances fer sure, but think Chrome, Deutsch Amerikan Friendschaft and you might start to get the idea."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "696edf2d-48c0-48bb-8f01-5f8733cf14a7",
                                                "sense_id": "9f4145ea-a5a9-33f4-a15b-d6d7b7dcd7b7",
                                                "text": "on 10.10.10 the new DREAM ITO DUST song \"counterfeit\" was released online in 6 different mixes plus a video. besides the original, there is a darkstep mix, a breakcore mix [bryin dall], an EBM mix [angztek industries], a cold wave mix [prequel], and a powernoise mix [theologian]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
